  "prefLabel": "He-W 573.11 Utilization Review and Control",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 573.11 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s provider program integrity unit shall monitor utilization of wheelchair van services, to identify, prevent, and correct potential occurrences of fraud, waste and abuse, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, and He-W 520.\n\nSource. #8563, eff 2-7-06; ss by #10605, eff 5-23-14",
